#AREA The Temple Dungeon~

#AUTHORS MrMud~

#HELPS
-1 JAIL IMPRISONMENT MRPD DUNGEON 'THE DUNGEON'~
All administrative players on MR have the ability to punish players by
sending them to the Temple Dungeon. An imprisoned player will stay in the 
Temple Dungeon and cannot communicate with the outside world until one's 
prison sentence expires.  The duration of the sentence can be found in the 
finger info of the captive.

           (A) Policies and Punishments                         
           (B) List of Legal and Illegal Practices


  The temple dungeon updated to ensure 
  prisoner captivity on 03 Dec 1999.


{-}MRPD
{a}MRPD1
{b}MRPD0
~
-1 MRPD1 RULES~
Rules of the Realm
----------------------------------------------------------------------
These rules are set up as a guideline for ensuring an enjoyable gaming
environment.  Some actions are more severe than others, and methods of
punishment is at the admin's discretion.  

If a rule for a particular situation is not posted here, you should
consider it as illegal until you find out otherwise.  Warnings are
generally given, but not required, before punishments are handed out.

              IGNORANCE OF THE RULES IS NOT AN EXCUSE!

 (A) Multi-Playing        (E) Scripts and Triggers  (I) Spamming     
 (B) Player Names         (F) Profanity             (J) Summoning Rules
 (C) Harassment           (G) Punishment            (K) Pkill Rules
 (D) Bug Abuse            (H) Sharing Characters    (L) Other


{a}MRPD2
{b}MRPD3
{c}MRPD4
{d}MRPD5
{e}MRPD6
{f}MRPD7
{g}MRPD8
