temple keeper~
The temple keeper~
The temple keeper is here.~
The temple keeper is here ready to supply you with everything you need.
 Say 'SPELLS'      for a full complement of spells.
 Say 'DISPEL'      for dispelling.
 Say 'CURSED'      to remove curses.
 Say 'RESTORE'     for healing.
 Say 'UNIFORM'     to receive the priest/priestess clothing.
~
