#12000
Center of the Temple Dungeon of Mortal Realms~
You stand within the center of the temple dungeon of Mortal Realms. Glancing 
around you can see the cook in the room above you.  To the east is the dungeon 
cell where prisoners are locked up.  The eastern room leads to an interrogation
room, while down in the depths below lies the dragon training area.~
120 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see the dungeon cell.~
~
